{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","commonName":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","title":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","order":53,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"151e26128ad00dd179d82309d785fe86e720d3a75301de7825a6b5ba5da4f48d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["請為我們禱告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄們，我還有話說：請你們為我們禱告，好叫主的道理快快行開，得着榮耀，正如在你們中間一樣，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["也叫我們脫離無理之惡人的手；因為人不都是有信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["但主是信實的，要堅固你們，保護你們脫離那惡者",{"noteId":1},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我們靠主深信，你們現在是遵行我們所吩咐的，後來也必要遵行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["願主引導你們的心，叫你們愛上帝，並學基督的忍耐！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警戒懶惰的人"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["弟兄們，我們奉主耶穌基督的名吩咐你們，凡有弟兄不按規矩而行，不遵守從我們所受的教訓，就當遠離他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你們自己原知道應當怎樣效法我們。因為我們在你們中間，未嘗不按規矩而行，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["也未嘗白吃人的飯，倒是辛苦勞碌，晝夜做工，免得叫你們一人受累。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這並不是因我們沒有權柄，乃是要給你們作榜樣，叫你們效法我們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我們在你們那裏的時候，曾吩咐你們說，若有人不肯做工，就不可吃飯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因我們聽說，在你們中間有人不按規矩而行，甚麼工都不做，反倒專管閒事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我們靠主耶穌基督吩咐、勸戒這樣的人，要安靜做工，吃自己的飯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["弟兄們，你們行善不可喪志。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["若有人不聽從我們這信上的話，要記下他，不和他交往，叫他自覺羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["但不要以他為仇人，要勸他如弟兄。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["願賜平安的主隨時隨事親自給你們平安！願主常與你們眾人同在！"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我－保羅親筆問你們安。凡我的信都以此為記，我的筆跡就是這樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["願我們主耶穌基督的恩常與你們眾人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：脫離凶惡","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}